    reg {
        name = "Sampling factor register";
        desc = "`JPGD_REG_SAMPLINGFACTOR`: `Y_H << 20 | Y_V << 16 | U_H << 12 | U_V << 8 | V_V << 4 | V_V` as written by U-Boot (the lowest nibble is written with the V vertical factor twice: probable vendor typo for V_H, kept as software behaviour).

Vendor U-Boot `product/hiosd/dec/hi_drv_jpeg_reg.h` + `hi_JpegDecode.c` (CONFIG_HI3520D: base 0x20670000, GIC ID 74, clock/reset PERI_CRG25 at 0x20030064). No reset values are known (not in the data sheet, never read).";

